<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Extra Arms</ansi> mutation

New arms sprout from your torso, one with each change, each able to
wield a weapon of its own. The grotesque sight of extra flailing limbs
draws hostile attention and unsettles everyone around you.

<ansi fg="yellow">Requires:</ansi>  Arms (a species with explicit grasping limbs)
<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active Ability
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Extremely Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Unlocks additional weapon slots: each change grows one more arm,
  up to six arms in all, so you can wield more weapons at once than a
  normal combatant
  Slightly improved dexterity from the additional limb coordination

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Greatly reduced charisma: so many arms are deeply disturbing to
  behold
  Draws significantly more hostile attention from enemies
  Your body holds part of your conviction in reserve, and the last
  change holds more than the others

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Clawed Hands, Elongated Limbs

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
